{"speciesId":571,"names":{"fr":"Zoroark","es":"Zoroark","en":"Zoroark","ja":"ゾロアーク"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ces Pokémon protègent les leurs en prenant l’apparence de leurs ennemis. Ils forment des groupes très soudés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il peut mystifier instantanément des foules d’humains. Il protège son habitat en créant des illusions de paysages."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Stories say those who tried to catch Zoroark were trapped in an illusion and punished."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Stories say those who tried to catch Zoroark were trapped in an illusion and punished."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il peut mystifier instantanément des foules d’humains. Il protège son habitat en créant des illusions de paysages."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene la facultad de confundir a muchos humanos a la vez. Protege su guarida creando un paisaje ilusorio."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"いっぺんに 大勢の 人を 化かす 力を 持つ。 幻の 景色を 見せて 住処を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ces Pokémon protègent les leurs en prenant l’apparence de leurs ennemis. Ils forment des groupes très soudés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Siempre ha protegido a su manada embaucando a sus enemigos. Dentro de la manada están todos muy unidos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"相手を 化かす ことで 群れの 安全を 守ってきた ポケモン。 仲間同士の 結束が 固い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il peut mystifier instantanément des foules d’humains. Il protège son habitat en créant des illusions de paysages."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene la facultad de confundir a muchos humanos a la vez. Protege su guarida creando un paisaje ilusorio."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Each has the ability to fool a large group of people simultaneously. They protect their lair with illusory scenery."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いっぺんに 大勢の 人を 化かす 力を 持つ。 幻の 景色を 見せて 住処を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ces Pokémon protègent les leurs en prenant l’apparence de leurs ennemis. Ils forment des groupes très soudés."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Siempre ha protegido a su manada embaucando a sus enemigos. Dentro de la manada están todos muy unidos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Bonds between these Pokémon are very strong. It protects the safety of its pack by tricking its opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"相手を 化かす ことで 群れの 安全を 守ってきた ポケモン。 仲間同士の 結束が 固い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il est non seulement capable de changer d’apparence, mais il peut également créer des illusions pour hypnotiser les humains."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"No solo es capaz de transformarse, sino que también puede crear ilusiones para confundir a cientos de personas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It doesn’t just transform itself—it also has the power to make hundreds of people see its illusions."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"何かに 化けるだけ ではなく 何百人もの 人に 幻を 見せる 力をもつ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Les humains qui osent menacer son habitat finissent par errer éternellement dans les bois, victimes de ses illusions."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Si percibe que un humano está amenazando su hábitat, crea visiones para aturdirlo y hacerlo vagar por el bosque sin cesar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"If it thinks humans are going to discover its den, Zoroark shows them visions that make them wander around in the woods."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"人間に 棲み処を 暴かれそうに なると 幻を みせて 森を 彷徨わせ 続ける という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Doté d’un grand sens de la camaraderie, ce Pokémon peut créer des illusions effrayantes pour protéger son habitat et ses congénères."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Cuida de sus semejantes. Provoca ilusiones terroríficas para proteger tanto su guarida como a su manada de sus adversarios."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon cares deeply about others of its kind, and it will conjure terrifying illusions to keep its den and pack safe."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"仲間想いの ポケモン。 恐ろしい 幻を 見せて すみかや 群れを 守るのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Les Dresseurs en manque de compagnie ordonnent à Zoroark de leur montrer une illusion pour tromper leur solitude."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Los Entrenadores solitarios le piden a Zoroark que les muestre ilusiones con las que combatir la desazón de la soledad."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Seeking to ease the burden of their solitude, lonely Trainers tell Zoroark to show illusions to them."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"孤独なトレーナーは ゾロアークに 幻を 見せるように 命じて ひとりの さみしさを 紛らわす。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"With its disheveled white fur, it looks like an embodiment of death. Heedless of its own safety, Zoroark attacks its nemeses with a bitter energy so intense, it lacerates Zoroark's own body."}],"varieties":[{"id":571,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level